.TH CRUNCH_SYSCTL 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
crunch_sysctl \- invokes obsolete _sysctl syscall 156 with a raw argument structure
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_extra.h>
.B int crunch_sysctl(void* arguments);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invokes obsolete _sysctl syscall 156 with a raw argument structure. Modern Linux kernels return ENOSYS.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR _sysctl (2)
